(Period of completion: 12 months) Tj T*
(Last date of submission: 25.12.2026 up to 15:00 hrs) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART A — INSTRUCTIONS TO BIDDERS) Tj T*
(1. The Department reserves the right to accept or reject any bid without assigning any) Tj T*
(reason.) Tj T*
(2. Conditional bids will be summarily rejected.) Tj T*
(3. The bidder shall submit the EMD in the form of online payment or bank guarantee from) Tj T*
(a scheduled bank.) Tj T*
(4. The successful bidder shall furnish a performance guarantee of 5 % of the contract) Tj T*
(value within 15 days.) Tj T*
(5. Bidders shall have completed at least one similar work of value not less than 40 % of) Tj T*
(the estimated cost during the last seven years.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(GENERAL CONDITIONS OF CONTRACT) Tj T*
(1. Income tax and GST shall be deducted at source as applicable.) Tj T*
(2. Rates quoted shall be inclusive of all taxes, freight, insurance and transit risks.) Tj T*
(3. All disputes shall be subject to arbitration under the Arbitration and Conciliation) Tj T*
(Act, 1996.) Tj T*
(4. Payment shall be made within 30 days of receipt of bills duly certified by the) Tj T*
(Engineer-in-charge.) Tj T*
(5. Liquidated damages at 0.5 % per week of delay shall be levied, subject to a maximum) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
