(SCOPE OF WORK) Tj T*
(This specification covers rural piped water supply scheme — pumping and treated water) Tj T*
(supply complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 3: HORIZONTAL CENTRIFUGAL PUMPS) Tj T*
(1. The pumps shall comply with IS 1520:1980.) Tj T*
(2. Discharge of each pump shall be 250 m3/hour.) Tj T*
(3. Pump efficiency at the duty point shall be 78% \(percent\) minimum. The pump casing) Tj T*
(shall be cast iron and the impeller bronze.) Tj T*
(4. The pumpset noise level measured 1 mtr away shall be limited to 85 decibels \(A\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PUMP DATA SHEET) Tj T*
(Rated discharge: 250 m3/hour) Tj T*
(Rated total head: 45 mtr) Tj T*
(Make and type: \(to be furnished by the bidder\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 4: DRIVE MOTORS) Tj T*
(1. Squirrel cage induction motors complying with IS 325:1996 shall be supplied.) Tj T*
(2. Motor rated output shall be 37 k.W.. Motors are to operate on 415-volt ± 10%) Tj T*
(\(percent\), 50 Hertz ± 5% \(percent\), three phase supply.) Tj T*
(3. Motors shall meet efficiency class IE3 of IS 12615:2018.) Tj T*
(4. Insulation shall be class F, with temperature rise restricted to class B, for) Tj T*
(continuous S1 duty.) Tj T*
(5. The motor synchronous speed shall be 1500 rpm..) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART E — TREATED WATER QUALITY) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 2 of 5) Tj T*
